        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nTWO BEDROOM / ONE BATHROOM HOUSE MONKSFIELD, CLONDALKIN AVAILABLE NOW\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom, one-bathroom house to the rental market in the popular Monksfield area of Clondalkin, Dublin 22.\nThis bright and well-presented house offers comfortable living in a convenient residential location. Monksfield is ideally situated close to Clondalkin Village and a host of local amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, parks and leisure facilities. The property also benefits from excellent transport links, with numerous bus routes nearby and easy access to the N7 and M50 motorway network.\nInternal accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a bright living room, a fully fitted kitchen and dining area, two generously sized bedrooms and a main bathroom. The property also benefits from a private rear garden and off-street parking.\nAVAILABLE NOW and viewing is highly advised.\nFeatures:\n<ul>\n <li>2 bedroom / 1 bathroom house</li>\n <li>Presented in good condition throughout</li>\n <li>Bright and well-presented living accommodation</li>\n <li>Fully fitted kitchen with dining area</li>\n <li>Two bedrooms</li>\n <li>Main bathroom</li>\n <li>Private rear garden</li>\n <li>Off-street parking</li>\n <li>Close to Clondalkin Village</li>\n <li>Excellent public transport links</li>\n <li>Easy access to N7 & M50 motorways</li>\n <li>A host of local amenities nearby</li>\n <li>AVAILABLE NOW!!</li>\n</ul>\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
